         tolerance: exact symbolic equality
         reading : chain rule through the OR: mu'(0) = b1 + b2, independent of c1, c2.
  [PASS] S1n [OR over 2 channels] generic engagement p_i = b_i Y (linear truncation): the origin slope equals the sum of slopes
